# memory

Durable facts, one topic per file. Indexed by [[MEMORY]].

**Why files rather than Claude's account memory:** account memory is per-user and private{{#if shared}} — with two or more co-users it diverges immediately{{/if}}. These files are shared, inspectable, diffable, and land in snapshots.

## Conventions

- `<topic>.md`, kebab-case. One subject per file.
- Start with a one-line summary, then detail.
- Absolute dates only.
- If a fact here is contradicted by a file in [[01 Master]], the Master file wins — fix this one.
